  "releaseNotes": "v1.0.3 - Symbol Support Added\n\t\t- Added debugging symbols (.snupkg) for better debugging experience\n\t\t- Source link support for step-through debugging\n\t\t- Fixed WindowsAppSDK packaging compatibility issues\n\t\t- Core library now packages without WinUI dependencies\n\t\tv1.0.2 - Bugfixes\n\t\t- Bugfixes\n\t\tv1.0.1 - Bugfixes\n\t\t- Bugfixes\n\t\tv1.0.0 - Initial Release:\n\t\t- JSON-first settings development with special naming convention\n\t\t- Bidirectional JSON ↔ C# object conversion\n\t\t- Automatic XAML UI generation for WinUI 3/WPF\n\t\t- FluentWinUIGenerator with Windows 11-style cards\n\t\t- Icons support with Segoe Fluent Icons\n\t\t- Category and list support\n\t\t- Built-in validation system\n\t\t- Extensible UI generation system\n\t\t- Full .NET 9 support",
